Prompt: Show me all the records that have LLC in the OwnerName field and give me the total count of records and a percentage of the total records 

Generated SQL:
SELECT COUNT(*) AS LLC_records_count, (CAST(COUNT(*) AS DOUBLE) * 100.0 / (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM v_all)) AS percentage_of_total FROM v_all WHERE OwnerName LIKE '%LLC%';

